This distribution is a modified fork. Changes from upstream include:

  * the marketing surfaces (landing page, pricing and use-cases routes) were
    removed, because this build ships embedded inside another product rather
    than as a site of its own;
  * the plan tiers no longer gate the product. Entitlement is decided by the
    host application before this tool loads, so the in-app upgrade prompts,
    plans and usage screens were removed and every account is granted the
    highest tier;
  * sign-in, sign-up and sign-out surfaces were removed. The session is
    established by the host;
  * upstream's contact address, domain and repository links were replaced with
    this distribution's own, so that support requests and source links reach
    the people running this build rather than the original author.

